    "description": "Discover the perfect blend of space, style, and location in this stunning contemporary vacant duplex in Central Sunset. Built in 1982, this expansive property offers approx. 4,320 sq ft across 8 bedrooms and 7 bathrooms. Each main unit features a spacious living room with fireplace, formal dining room, bright kitchen with dining area, and 3 bedrooms with 2 full baths. The top-floor penthouse adds even more appeal with its own living room and fireplace, 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms,  and access to two private roof decks, one with sweeping ocean views. The large basement includes an additional bathroom and flexible space ideal for a media room, guest suite, or home office. A side-by-side 3-car garage offers ample parking and storage, while the flat backyard includes a large shed and room to relax or entertain. Just moments from Irving Street's vibrant corridor, Golden Gate Park, and a short drive to UCSF, this home offers unbeatable convenience with nearby Muni lines and easy access to restaurants, groceries, and more. A true Central Sunset gem."
  },
